{
  "name": "Blob, 47 pieces (Godot 3x3 minimal)",
  "doc": "The standard 47-piece blob: every combination of the 8 neighbours where a corner only counts when both edges beside it are filled. Layout: Godot's \"3x3 minimal\" 12x4 terrain template, origin = its top-left tile, cell (10, 1) unused. Rule m<mask> draws the piece for neighbour mask N=1, NE=2, E=4, SE=8, S=16, SW=32, W=64, NW=128. # is the filled terrain, S anything else; remap them with the reference's legend. Cells off the level read as empty.",
  "legend": { "#": "+", "S": "." },
  "rules": [
    { "slug": "m16", "match": { "rows": ["*S*", "S#S", "*#*"] }, "out": { "tiles": [[0, 0]] }, "break": true, "out_of_bounds": "." },
    { "slug": "m20", "match": { "rows": ["*S*", "S##", "*#S"] }, "out": { "tiles": [[1, 0]] }, "break": true, "out_of_bounds": "." },
